# Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/awr.
# awr (feminine), plural oriau.  Opens on a vowel, so no mutation
# reaches it; "dwy awr" is attested unmutated in running text.
# A Welsh numeral is followed by the singular (or, for the year, its count
# form), so both the counted forms and the ordinary plural are surfaces of
# this unit.
awr
oriau
